t to consider the sample size and balance of the design to ensure the robustness of the results.\n\n**Software Implementation:**\nTukey's Test can be implemented in various statistical software packages, including R (using the `TukeyHSD` function), SAS (using the `Tukey` option in PROC GLM), and SPSS (using the post-hoc tests option in ANOVA procedures).\n\n**Common Applications or Examples:**\nTukey's Test is commonly used in agricultural experiments to compare the effects of different fertilizers on crop yield, in clinical trials to assess the efficacy of different treatments, and in industrial settings to evaluate the performance of different manufacturing processes. It is particularly valuable in any scenario where multiple group comparisons are necessary following an ANOVA.", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": [], "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}, "content_filter_results": {"hate": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "protected_material_code": {"filtered": false, "detected": false}, "protected_material_text": {"filtered": false, "detected": false}, "self_harm": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "sexual": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "violence": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}}}], "created": 1768462371, "model": "gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18", "object": "chat.completion", "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "fp_f97eff32c5", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 945, "prompt_tokens": 327, "total_tokens": 1272, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": 0}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 0}}, "prompt_filter_results": [{"prompt_index": 0, "content_filter_results": {"hate": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "jailbreak": {"filtered": false, "detected": false}, "self_harm": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "sexual": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "violen